        {
          "monster": "ghoul",
          "cell": [
            20,
            5
          ]
        },
        {
          "monster": "ghoul",
          "cell": [
            24,
            8
          ]
        },
        {
          "monster": "ghoul",
          "cell": [
            22,
            11
          ]
        },
        {
          "monster": "ghoul",
          "cell": [
            26,
            14
          ]
        },
        {
          "monster": "ghast",
          "cell": [
            27,
            6
          ]
        },
        {
          "monster": "ghast",
          "cell": [
            28,
            10
          ]
        }
      ],
      "text": "The smell reaches you first, sweet and wrong. Then the things that died on these hills and didn't stay down come crawling out of the bracken, grinning."
    },
    {
      "id": "howl_call",
      "weight": 2,
